<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Our Story - Nizam & Nurain</title>

<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f5efe6;
    color: #3d3028;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
}

.book {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 25px;
}

.cover {
    min-height: 90vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
}

.cover h1 {
    font-size: 45px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.cover p {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-style: italic;
}

.chapter {
    background: #fffaf3;
    padding: 35px 25px;
    margin: 30px 0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}

.chapter h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.chapter p {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.9;
}

.next {
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
    margin: 30px auto;
    padding: 12px 25px;
    background: #3d3028;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 25px;
}

.final {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 80px 20px;
}

.final h1 {
    font-size: 38px;
}

.heart {
    font-size: 50px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="book">

<section class="cover">
    <div class="heart">❤️</div>
    <h1>Our Story</h1>
    <p>A story about Nizam & Nurain</p>
    <p>“Some stories begin unexpectedly...”</p>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
    <h2>Chapter 1 — The Beginning</h2>

    <p>
    There was a time when I never imagined that someone could become
    this important to me.
    </p>

    <p>
    Then you came into my life, Nurain.
    </p>

    <p>
    At first, I only wanted to know you. I wanted to be your friend,
    someone you could talk to, someone who would be there when you needed
    someone.
    </p>

    <p>
    But slowly, something changed inside me.
    </p>

    <p>
    I started looking forward to your messages.
    I started smiling whenever I saw your name.
    And without realizing it, I started caring about you more than I
    planned to.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
    <h2>Chapter 2 — When I Started Falling</h2>

    <p>
    I tried to tell myself that we were just friends.
    </p>

    <p>
    But the heart doesn't always listen to what the mind says.
    </p>

    <p>
    Every conversation made me feel closer to you.
    Every little moment with you became something I wanted to remember.
    </p>

    <p>
    And one day I finally realized...
    </p>

    <p style="text-align:center; font-size:24px;">
    I was falling for you.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="chapter">
    <h2>Chapter 3 — You</h2>

    <p>
    Nurain, I don't know exactly when you became someone so special to me.
    </p>

    <p>
    Maybe it happened through our conversations.
    Maybe it happened through the little things you did.
    </p>

    <p>
    But I know one thing.
    </p>

    <p>
    I don't want this story to end here.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="final">
    <div class="heart">❤️</div>

    <h1>Nurain...</h1>

    <p style="font-size:22px;">
    I wanted to ask you something.
    </p>

    <h1>Will You Marry Me?</h1>

    <div class="heart">💍</div>

    <p>
    Love, Nizam
    </p>
</section>

</div>

</body>
</html>
